WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:37.870
Episode 15

01:38.690 --> 01:41.320
They all died.

01:42.770 --> 01:44.320
Something must be going wrong.

01:44.500 --> 01:46.920
If the commander committed suicide
because he colluded with the enemy,

01:46.940 --> 01:48.450
how about his servants?

01:48.580 --> 01:50.530
Why did they also do that?

01:51.180 --> 01:52.920
He just received visitors in the study,

01:52.940 --> 01:54.530
but they're gone.

01:55.540 --> 01:56.520
It's all my fault.

01:56.540 --> 01:57.180
If I had told you earlier

01:57.180 --> 01:58.920
about this matter,

01:59.050 --> 02:00.960
maybe they could've been saved.

02:00.980 --> 02:02.680
The same thing would happen even if you had.

02:03.130 --> 02:05.200
They want me to be here a little late.

02:05.220 --> 02:06.920
Just a little late.

02:06.940 --> 02:10.400
This is a warning. This is a threat.

02:12.900 --> 02:14.540
It must be someone with supreme power

02:14.540 --> 02:17.730
so that he can eradicate the whole
family of the commander in a flash.

02:30.980 --> 02:32.640
How is it going at you side?

02:35.090 --> 02:37.610
This is the token of the secret agent from Beiqi.

02:37.820 --> 02:39.070
Token?

02:39.090 --> 02:40.180
Beiqi has secret agents

02:40.180 --> 02:41.680
that lurk in Nanqing.

02:41.700 --> 02:43.980
They use tokens like this to deploy subordinates

02:43.980 --> 02:45.690
and conduct activities.

02:45.820 --> 02:47.370
In that sense,

02:47.620 --> 02:49.470
Cheng Jushu is a Beiqi secret agent.

02:49.490 --> 02:50.970
I'm afraid so!

02:56.490 --> 02:58.690
What an honor to me!

02:59.370 --> 03:01.040
This unknown big hand

03:01.060 --> 03:02.680
unites Beiqi

03:02.700 --> 03:05.320
just to kill me.

03:05.340 --> 03:06.560
Your Excellency,

03:06.820 --> 03:08.270
It's getting more and more complicated.

03:08.290 --> 03:09.160
Do we still need to continue with it?

03:09.180 --> 03:10.400
Yes, we do!

03:11.650 --> 03:13.840
We can't let Teng Zijing die for nothing.

03:15.290 --> 03:16.920
I'll never give up

03:17.490 --> 03:18.760
before finding out the true killer.

03:18.780 --> 03:21.450
But all the clues are ended now.

03:27.570 --> 03:28.820
How is it going

03:28.820 --> 03:29.680
with that big guy?

03:29.700 --> 03:30.450
Why did you

03:30.450 --> 03:31.680
fight him?

03:31.700 --> 03:32.880
Where did you see him?

03:32.900 --> 03:33.650
In a courtyard beside the stable

03:33.650 --> 03:35.730
on Dashu Street.

03:37.730 --> 03:39.090
Maybe not!

03:39.930 --> 03:41.320
Let's forget about

03:41.340 --> 03:43.320
the identity of the big hand behind the scene,

03:43.340 --> 03:45.240
the involvement of the Beiqi secret agents,

03:45.260 --> 03:46.830
the private sales of military supplies,

03:46.850 --> 03:48.560
and the eradication of the commander's family.

03:49.490 --> 03:50.370
What do we investigate then

03:50.370 --> 03:52.070
if we forget them all?

03:52.090 --> 03:53.830
Forget about all the non-essentials

03:53.850 --> 03:55.520
and focus on the assassination itself.

03:55.540 --> 03:57.060
Why did Cheng Jushu and the female assassinators

03:57.060 --> 03:59.170
choose Niulan Street for the assassination?

03:59.700 --> 04:02.640
You were heading towards Joy Tsin House

04:02.780 --> 04:04.630
and would undoubtedly pass by Niulan Street.

04:04.650 --> 04:06.560
How did they know it?

04:07.010 --> 04:08.340
Perhaps they didn't.

04:08.340 --> 04:09.730
They just followed secretly

04:09.730 --> 04:11.290
and planned to do it by chance.

04:11.290 --> 04:12.690
Not possible!

04:14.010 --> 04:16.400
Two assassinators attacked from front
and back respectively that day.

04:16.420 --> 04:18.030
Cheng Jushu hid at the back of the wall.

04:18.050 --> 04:18.700
It was an ambush

04:18.700 --> 04:20.250
well planned in advance.

04:20.650 --> 04:23.010
They had known I would pass by Niulan Street well before it.

04:23.210 --> 04:24.210
Who else knew

04:24.210 --> 04:25.400
you were going to Joy Tsin House?

04:25.420 --> 04:27.530
A lot of people could know that.

04:27.580 --> 04:28.840
People from your residence?

04:28.860 --> 04:30.190
They have nothing to do with it.

04:30.210 --> 04:31.370
Is it possible that

04:31.370 --> 04:32.850
they leaked it unintentionally?

04:33.050 --> 04:34.440
Don't think too much.

04:34.460 --> 04:37.090
The person who made the appointment with me naturally knew it.

04:37.170 --> 04:38.810
The Second Prince?

04:41.650 --> 04:42.860
He is under too much suspicion

04:42.860 --> 04:43.680
to do it

04:43.700 --> 04:45.130
which makes it seem deliberate.

04:45.420 --> 04:46.880
Then there isn't any more suspect left.

04:47.330 --> 04:48.520
Aren't you aware

04:48.540 --> 04:50.410
since it was an appointment,

04:50.650 --> 04:51.890
Joy Tsin House would need to

04:51.890 --> 04:53.410
prepare the banquet in advance.

04:53.980 --> 04:55.880
It's the people from Joy Tsin House?!

04:56.650 --> 04:57.490
They also knew

04:57.490 --> 04:59.560
I would pass by Niulan Street.

04:59.580 --> 05:00.520
But Miss Si Lili and you

05:00.540 --> 05:01.590
like each other so much.

05:01.610 --> 05:02.310
People from her side

05:02.330 --> 05:03.520
shouldn't have any problem.

05:03.540 --> 05:04.740
I have no connection

05:04.740 --> 05:06.370
with Si Lili.

05:06.540 --> 05:08.570
In retrospect,

05:08.860 --> 05:09.930
this Miss

05:09.930 --> 05:11.170
doesn't look like

05:11.170 --> 05:12.690
a courtesan in brothel at all.

05:15.820 --> 05:16.770
So we need to go

05:16.770 --> 05:18.810
to Joy Tsin House immediately.

05:19.820 --> 05:21.290
Exactly!

05:22.420 --> 05:23.260
Let me in!

05:23.260 --> 05:23.820
No! No!

05:23.820 --> 05:25.300
Sir, you can't come inside.

05:25.300 --> 05:27.000
Why not?

05:27.020 --> 05:28.680
Listen!

05:28.700 --> 05:29.890
I made an appointment

05:29.890 --> 05:32.310
with Miss Yunjian a long time ago.

05:32.330 --> 05:33.910
What's the reason not to let me in?

05:33.930 --> 05:35.050
There is no reason.

05:35.050 --> 05:35.740
I must get in!

05:35.740 --> 05:36.820
Sir!

05:37.210 --> 05:37.930
Sir!

05:37.930 --> 05:39.260
You probably don't know that

05:39.260 --> 05:41.090
Miss Si Lili's boat

05:41.090 --> 05:42.570
has been burnt.

05:42.770 --> 05:43.980
The government is investigating

05:43.980 --> 05:45.090
the cause of the fire.

05:45.090 --> 05:46.420
No one is allowed to go inside.

05:46.420 --> 05:48.520
Please forgive us.

05:48.540 --> 05:50.370
I didn't set up the fire.

05:50.370 --> 05:51.800
I must go in.

05:51.820 --> 05:53.210
Gentlemen, please!

05:53.210 --> 05:54.370
Please don't go in there!

05:54.370 --> 05:55.800
Excuse me, please!

05:55.820 --> 05:56.580
Go! Go! Go!

05:56.580 --> 05:57.840
Excuse me!

05:57.860 --> 05:59.860
You said the boat got burnt?

05:59.860 --> 06:01.250
When did that happen?

06:01.700 --> 06:04.200
Sir, it was this noon.

06:05.090 --> 06:06.090
It's such a pity

06:06.090 --> 06:07.490
that a good boat got burnt

06:07.490 --> 06:09.520
to ashes.

06:09.540 --> 06:11.160
Where is Si Lili now?

06:11.420 --> 06:12.470
She left!

06:12.490 --> 06:14.810
Someone saw her going out of the city.

06:15.260 --> 06:16.370
She must be frustrated

06:16.370 --> 06:18.600
that the boat got burnt.

06:19.610 --> 06:20.350
Gentlemen,

06:20.370 --> 06:21.770
please come some other day.

06:21.770 --> 06:22.540
Please...

06:22.540 --> 06:24.320
Excuse us, please!

06:26.890 --> 06:28.070
There is no clue

06:28.090 --> 06:29.800
up to this point.

06:29.820 --> 06:31.130
Your Excellency,

06:32.370 --> 06:34.070
if we can find Si Lili,

06:34.090 --> 06:36.290
there should be some clue.

06:36.740 --> 06:37.770
Didn't you hear it?

06:37.770 --> 06:38.770
She's gone for quite a while.

06:38.770 --> 06:40.040
How do we find her?!

06:42.770 --> 06:45.330
Maybe you don't know that

06:45.330 --> 06:46.590
the Investigator's Office

06:46.610 --> 06:49.440
has two masters of hunting.

06:49.540 --> 06:50.630
One of them

06:50.650 --> 06:52.140
is called Zong Zhui.

06:52.140 --> 06:53.520
Generally, he follows the Head.

06:53.540 --> 06:55.370
He is not in the capital city now.

06:57.050 --> 06:59.250
As for the other one,

07:01.540 --> 07:03.750
would you like to have a guess

07:03.770 --> 07:06.920
who the other guy is?

07:11.330 --> 07:13.320
Is that you?

07:13.980 --> 07:15.880
I'm afraid yes.

07:16.490 --> 07:17.610
It's surprising

07:17.610 --> 07:19.690
that you are just a clerk with that skill.

07:19.860 --> 07:22.150
Being a clerk is pretty good.

07:22.170 --> 07:25.250
It runs no risk and therefore super safe.

07:25.980 --> 07:27.440
Why do you help me?

07:27.980 --> 07:29.370
Your Excellency,

07:29.650 --> 07:32.330
I'm driven out

07:32.330 --> 07:33.370
by the Investigator's Office now.

07:33.370 --> 07:35.720
But my whole family

07:35.740 --> 07:37.310
still needs sustenance.

07:37.330 --> 07:39.420
I learned that by working for you,

07:39.420 --> 07:41.350
I can earn 50 taels of silver a month,

07:41.370 --> 07:43.440
and there is land and ox.

07:46.890 --> 07:48.090
If you can really hunt her down for me,

07:48.090 --> 07:49.590
I'll give you 10 extra pigs.

07:49.610 --> 07:50.870
Fantastic!

07:50.890 --> 07:52.280
Your Excellency,

07:52.300 --> 07:53.170
my girl

07:53.170 --> 07:55.560
loves pork belly best.

07:55.580 --> 07:57.120
Are you really able to hunt her down?

07:57.140 --> 07:59.440
That's not a problem to me.

07:59.460 --> 08:01.150
The problem lies in you.

08:01.170 --> 08:01.960
What do you mean?

08:01.980 --> 08:04.480
Si Lili left the capital city so timely.

08:04.890 --> 08:06.160
She could most likely

08:06.260 --> 08:07.460
be the Beiqi secret agent

08:07.460 --> 08:09.400
in view of it.

08:09.420 --> 08:11.240
Her escape

08:11.260 --> 08:12.860
must be a plan well in advance

08:12.860 --> 08:14.120
so as to coordinate with the backup team.

08:14.140 --> 08:16.030
If Your Excellency must hunt her down,

08:16.050 --> 08:18.240
we must go out of the capital city

08:18.260 --> 08:21.120
and run endless risks

08:21.140 --> 08:22.750
to our lives.

08:22.770 --> 08:23.850
Your Excellency,

08:24.140 --> 08:26.920
are you willing to step on such a dangerous journey?

08:27.860 --> 08:30.440
It was my brother who was murdered.

08:30.460 --> 08:31.640
In that case,

08:31.900 --> 08:34.650
please follow me to go out of the capital city

08:34.730 --> 08:37.010
and start up this long journey.

08:47.260 --> 08:48.890
Where are you going?

08:49.900 --> 08:50.950
Where to?

08:50.970 --> 08:52.120
Aren't we going out of here?

08:52.140 --> 08:53.030
What do you want to do here?

08:53.050 --> 08:56.010
All my equipment is at home.

08:56.170 --> 08:58.250
I need to fetch them.

09:11.050 --> 09:12.520
Is this your house?

09:13.700 --> 09:15.240
Yes, it is.

09:15.260 --> 09:17.890
Why don't you just walk in?

09:20.100 --> 09:23.080
My wife is home. It's better to be careful.

09:23.100 --> 09:24.560
Wang Qinian,

09:24.580 --> 09:26.130
you're henpecked!

09:27.260 --> 09:28.760
Your Excellency,

09:28.780 --> 09:31.450
my wife has a nickname,

09:32.260 --> 09:35.320
tigress-like Mrs. Wang.

09:35.340 --> 09:36.470
What like?

09:36.490 --> 09:38.480
Tigress.

09:38.580 --> 09:41.030
Si Lili has gone for a while.

09:41.050 --> 09:42.170
Let's hurry up.

09:42.170 --> 09:43.030
It's fine!

09:43.050 --> 09:44.350
It's easier to hunt

09:44.370 --> 09:46.330
in day time.

09:51.820 --> 09:53.570
My wife is deeply asleep.

09:54.020 --> 09:55.400
Excuse me for a while.

09:55.970 --> 09:57.920
I'll be back soon.

09:58.530 --> 10:00.450
Please keep silent, Your Excellency!

10:17.100 --> 10:18.530
Where are you going again, Wang Qinian?

10:18.530 --> 10:20.050
Did you hide money in the case?

10:20.050 --> 10:21.240
Listen to me, darling!

10:21.260 --> 10:24.330
I've got business to do.

10:43.610 --> 10:44.410
Done, Your Excellency!

10:44.410 --> 10:45.960
It's done! Let's go!

10:49.410 --> 10:51.760
Your Excellency!

10:51.780 --> 10:53.150
Well done!

10:53.170 --> 10:54.920
That's admiring.

10:59.100 --> 11:00.570
Did you just say that

11:00.700 --> 11:02.590
it's easier to hunt in day time?

11:02.610 --> 11:03.720
Yes!

11:05.290 --> 11:06.960
Then I also have a person to meet.

11:51.340 --> 11:53.130
Why haven't you gone to bed?

11:53.970 --> 11:56.480
I heard that you killed a man on the street.

11:59.340 --> 12:00.910
I'm not fond of killing people.

12:00.930 --> 12:03.600
That was to avenge Zijing.

12:03.820 --> 12:06.350
Avenging friends is what man should do.

12:06.370 --> 12:07.890
But today,

12:08.050 --> 12:10.250
you're not here to see me.

12:10.290 --> 12:11.440
How can you tell?

12:11.460 --> 12:13.470
You didn't wear the nocturnal costume

12:13.490 --> 12:15.650
or the perfume.

12:19.460 --> 12:20.810
Wan'er,

12:21.140 --> 12:22.650
Si Lili from Joy Tsin House

12:22.970 --> 12:24.440
may have a hand

12:24.460 --> 12:26.210
in the assassination.

12:27.340 --> 12:30.400
She is at large out of the capital city.

12:31.050 --> 12:32.720
I have to get her back.

12:32.900 --> 12:34.080
You are leaving soon?

12:34.100 --> 12:35.440
Yes, but I thought you'll be worried.

12:35.460 --> 12:36.350
So here I am to say goodbye.

12:36.370 --> 12:37.120
When will you be back?

12:37.140 --> 12:37.880
As soon as I get her.

12:37.900 --> 12:39.650
What if you don't?

12:44.340 --> 12:45.910
I won't stop you

12:45.930 --> 12:47.370
from what you want to do,

12:49.050 --> 12:51.040
but it's impossible for me

12:51.410 --> 12:52.810
not to worry.

12:59.260 --> 13:00.600
Wan'er.

13:06.290 --> 13:08.330
How about a hug before I leave?

13:15.900 --> 13:20.250
It's dawn. I gotta go.

13:34.140 --> 13:36.280
I'll be worried every day.

13:36.900 --> 13:39.160
If you don't want me to,

13:40.170 --> 13:42.010
come back.

14:34.260 --> 14:35.320
The gate is open now.

14:35.340 --> 14:37.040
It is the right time to go out.

14:46.530 --> 14:47.890
Don't panic!

14:58.490 --> 14:59.890
Your Excellency,

15:01.220 --> 15:02.440
it's His Majesty's will

15:02.460 --> 15:04.250
to let me kill Cheng Jushu.

15:04.340 --> 15:06.650
Do you want to disobey His Majesty's will?

15:08.930 --> 15:11.040
It is him that I am arresting.

15:12.050 --> 15:13.100
Wang Qinian

15:13.100 --> 15:15.350
secretly checked the confidential files.

15:15.370 --> 15:17.020
According to the rule in the Investigator's Office,

15:17.020 --> 15:19.130
he must be interrogated.

15:19.780 --> 15:22.330
Here is the Director-General's token.
Who dare to touch him?!

15:28.900 --> 15:30.480
The Director-General

15:30.660 --> 15:32.880
shall also obey the rule in the Investigator's Office.

15:32.900 --> 15:34.460
I designated Wang Qinian

15:34.460 --> 15:36.030
to do it all.

15:36.050 --> 15:37.590
You are still young.

15:37.610 --> 15:39.200
I'm afraid you were cheated by him.

15:39.220 --> 15:40.480
Take him!

16:13.610 --> 16:15.250
Your Highness Earl Sinan!

16:20.730 --> 16:23.250
Your Excellency, it's been a long time.

16:24.730 --> 16:26.590
He is a kid and knows nothing.

16:26.610 --> 16:28.810
Please forgive him for my sake.

16:44.340 --> 16:46.450
I know it all about what happened to you.

16:46.580 --> 16:47.910
What's the plan?

16:47.930 --> 16:49.400
We're going out of the capital
city to hunt down the suspect.

16:51.610 --> 16:53.260
These guards have special identity.

16:53.260 --> 16:54.910
They can't go out without permission.

16:54.930 --> 16:57.570
So I can't send anyone to go with you.

16:58.140 --> 16:59.720
It's enough for just the two of us.

17:05.580 --> 17:07.480
I'm really regretful

17:07.500 --> 17:09.170
to have got you here.

17:12.010 --> 17:13.250
Off you go!

17:25.250 --> 17:27.110
Your dad is awesome.

17:27.130 --> 17:29.320
These guards are imperial guards.

17:29.340 --> 17:30.200
Even Prince Jing doesn't necessarily

17:30.220 --> 17:32.170
have guards like that.

17:38.860 --> 17:40.380
Your Excellency, the horses from just now

17:40.380 --> 17:41.320
are military horses.

17:41.340 --> 17:42.230
I know.

17:42.250 --> 17:43.010
The Ministry of Revenue

17:43.010 --> 17:44.110
should not have guards like that.

17:44.130 --> 17:45.840
Should we get it investigated?

17:46.010 --> 17:47.220
Those guards are most probably

17:47.220 --> 17:49.560
guards for His Majesty.

17:49.580 --> 17:51.840
That's a lot of trust from His Majesty to Earl Sinan.

17:53.380 --> 17:54.860
The Head told us

17:54.860 --> 17:55.960
before he left

17:55.980 --> 17:57.840
that do not collide with Earl Sinan

17:57.860 --> 17:59.250
unless it's national treason

17:59.250 --> 18:00.720
or regicide.

18:00.740 --> 18:03.170
That's very special treatment for an Assistant Minister.

18:03.460 --> 18:05.340
The Assistant Minister of Ministry of Revenue

18:05.340 --> 18:07.770
and the Head were serving His Majesty

18:07.770 --> 18:08.910
ever since His Majesty was a crown prince.

18:08.930 --> 18:11.440
That's very unusual friendship.

18:29.740 --> 18:32.200
Assistant Minister of Ministry of Revenue Fan Jian

18:32.220 --> 18:34.410
pays respects to Your Majesty!

18:36.340 --> 18:38.150
Do you know why you are summoned here?

18:38.170 --> 18:39.530
Yes, I do.

18:39.530 --> 18:40.720
Say it!

18:41.460 --> 18:44.910
I used the guards from Your Majesty

18:44.930 --> 18:47.560
to stop the Investigator's Office.

18:49.380 --> 18:50.480
Do you admit it's wrong?

18:50.500 --> 18:51.360
I don't think it's wrong,

18:51.380 --> 18:53.270
but if Your Majesty want to punish me for it,

18:53.290 --> 18:55.720
I can take it.

18:55.740 --> 18:58.720
Is it not wrong to go beyond your power?!

18:58.740 --> 19:01.200
I indeed went beyond my power,

19:01.220 --> 19:02.200
but that was to help Fan Xian

19:02.220 --> 19:03.360
get out of the capital city,

19:03.380 --> 19:04.580
which is to hunt down

19:04.580 --> 19:06.110
the Beiqi secret agent,

19:06.130 --> 19:08.010
Si Lili.

19:10.700 --> 19:15.080
Who gave Fan Xian that power?

19:18.700 --> 19:20.270
It is right Your Majesty!

19:20.290 --> 19:22.150
I didn't issue that order.

19:22.170 --> 19:24.290
Your Majesty surely didn't,

19:24.290 --> 19:27.030
but as Your Majesty's servant, I should
be able to comprehend your will

19:27.050 --> 19:29.960
even without an order.

19:29.980 --> 19:32.410
If Your Majesty don't want Fan Xian

19:32.410 --> 19:33.720
to handle this matter,

19:33.740 --> 19:35.580
then you won't let him know

19:35.580 --> 19:37.360
that Cheng Jushu was released.

19:37.380 --> 19:39.770
And less likely to release him

19:39.770 --> 19:41.800
after he killed Cheng Jushu.

19:42.380 --> 19:45.510
Wang Qinian secretly checked the confidential
files of the Investigator's Office.

19:45.530 --> 19:47.910
Zhu Ge wanted to convict him,

19:47.930 --> 19:50.600
but also got suppressed by Your Majesty.

19:50.620 --> 19:52.530
All of that

19:52.530 --> 19:56.080
is to let Fan Xian go on with the investigation.

19:57.530 --> 19:58.360
Done?

19:58.380 --> 19:59.600
Not yet!

19:59.860 --> 20:03.990
I have to talk about the cause as well.

20:04.010 --> 20:06.720
Fan Xian has no titles.

20:06.740 --> 20:08.770
Why do Your Majesty

20:08.770 --> 20:10.480
want him to investigate it?

20:10.500 --> 20:12.870
Your Majesty want to test his capability.

20:12.890 --> 20:14.390
Once he gets married,

20:14.410 --> 20:17.340
he will become the manager of Neiku

20:17.340 --> 20:18.870
to manage all the assets and power.

20:18.890 --> 20:20.440
There will be

20:20.460 --> 20:23.870
lots of underwater competition by then.

20:23.890 --> 20:25.990
He will mess it up if he is incapable.

20:26.010 --> 20:28.080
Hunting down Si Lili

20:28.100 --> 20:30.270
is a test

20:30.290 --> 20:34.050
from which you can observe his judgement and actions.

20:37.650 --> 20:39.440
What if your guess

20:41.820 --> 20:44.910
is all wrong?!

20:44.930 --> 20:48.390
I've been serving Your Majesty for so many years.

20:48.410 --> 20:51.600
I believe my own judgement.

20:51.980 --> 20:54.440
Besides, if I'm really wrong,

20:54.460 --> 20:56.750
Your Majesty won't mind

20:56.770 --> 20:58.860
in view of my loyalty

20:58.860 --> 21:02.530
and my thoughtfulness to Your Majesty's will.

21:05.700 --> 21:08.930
Does Fan Xian learn all his cunningness

21:08.980 --> 21:11.800
from you?

21:12.930 --> 21:15.320
I'm kind in nature

21:15.340 --> 21:17.650
and can't take comments like that.

21:18.980 --> 21:21.130
Kind in nature?

21:23.890 --> 21:27.360
Do you think Fan Xian can catch her?

21:27.380 --> 21:31.770
I bet he can!

21:32.100 --> 21:35.050
You intend to make a bet with me?

21:35.130 --> 21:37.110
I've been managing the Ministry of Revenue.

21:37.130 --> 21:40.530
Calculating and gambling is my expertise.

21:41.290 --> 21:43.820
Why you lose to your own son

21:43.820 --> 21:45.680
in Pai Gow?

21:46.410 --> 21:49.560
How do Your Majesty know this?

21:50.700 --> 21:52.030
Can't I know it?

21:52.050 --> 21:53.320
Yes, of course you can.

21:53.980 --> 21:55.910
Your Majesty can have transparency

21:55.930 --> 21:58.110
about all the things I do.

21:58.130 --> 21:59.600
Your transparency?!

22:01.860 --> 22:03.480
How about Fan Xian?

22:05.050 --> 22:06.440
Well...

22:07.980 --> 22:11.010
Your Majesty have to ask him on your own.

22:15.700 --> 22:20.680
That depends on if he can catch the suspect.

22:34.860 --> 22:36.080
Watch out!

22:36.100 --> 22:37.530
I'm sorry!

22:40.130 --> 22:42.510
Your Excellency,

22:42.530 --> 22:44.680
they said they were on duty yesterday as well.

22:44.700 --> 22:45.960
They saw Si Lili

22:45.980 --> 22:47.220
fleeing out of town.

22:47.220 --> 22:48.100
Which direction did she go?

22:48.100 --> 22:49.270
To the north.

22:49.290 --> 22:50.890
Then a few horses showed up.

22:50.890 --> 22:52.510
The riders wear bamboo hats with similar dresses.

22:52.530 --> 22:54.270
It's difficult to tell which one is Si Lili.

22:54.290 --> 22:56.650
Then they went in their own separate ways.

22:58.980 --> 23:01.080
So well-prepared they are!

23:02.650 --> 23:04.130
What's wrong, Your Excellency?

23:06.220 --> 23:07.480
Nothing.

23:07.500 --> 23:09.410
I feel like something is not right.

23:10.890 --> 23:12.200
What is it?

23:12.650 --> 23:14.080
It's hard to say.

23:14.220 --> 23:15.220
It could be the way

23:15.220 --> 23:17.080
Si Lili escaped.

23:18.930 --> 23:22.320
Multiple teams starting out together to create confusion.

23:22.340 --> 23:24.440
That's a smart way to escape.

23:24.460 --> 23:25.560
I know,

23:25.580 --> 23:27.650
but still something is missed out.

23:27.700 --> 23:29.130
Let's leave it!

23:29.380 --> 23:30.440
How do you plan to hunt?

23:30.460 --> 23:33.440
Your Excellency, please follow me.

23:36.080 --> 23:40.030
=Investigator's Office=

23:46.650 --> 23:49.410
Your Excellency, the pigeons fetched some messages again.

23:59.010 --> 24:00.480
What are you doing?

24:00.890 --> 24:02.200
Shoot a bird!

24:04.580 --> 24:05.930
Where is the bird?!

24:07.500 --> 24:08.510
It will come

24:08.530 --> 24:10.050
in a minute.

24:14.130 --> 24:15.130
Si Lili arranged six teams to go north

24:15.130 --> 24:16.010
as the escaping plan.

24:16.010 --> 24:16.650
Two of their whereabouts

24:16.650 --> 24:17.910
have been captured by our regional secret agents.

24:17.930 --> 24:18.930
The rest are being tracked.

24:18.930 --> 24:21.200
Fan Xian must be after her out of the capital city.

24:21.290 --> 24:22.410
It's not a concern

24:22.410 --> 24:23.630
with his personal effort.

24:23.650 --> 24:24.530
Si Lili will not

24:24.530 --> 24:26.080
go out of our hands after all.

24:26.100 --> 24:27.010
They would never expect

24:27.010 --> 24:28.270
Your Excellency has detected it a long time ago

24:28.290 --> 24:30.480
and sent different source of secret agents to investigate it.

24:30.500 --> 24:32.250
Hunt down her teams one by one.

24:32.340 --> 24:34.030
Don't let her escape out of Nanqing.

24:34.050 --> 24:35.250
Yes!

24:43.410 --> 24:44.560
There it goes!

24:56.130 --> 24:57.560
A carrier pigeon?!

24:58.770 --> 25:01.770
A carrier pigeon of the Investigator's Office.

25:03.740 --> 25:06.800
Si Lili burnt the boat

25:07.130 --> 25:08.560
and rode a horse out of town.

25:08.580 --> 25:09.740
It must attract the attention

25:09.740 --> 25:11.650
of the Investigator's Office.

25:12.100 --> 25:14.530
Even though she arranged six teams,

25:14.620 --> 25:16.770
her rough direction is to the north.

25:16.980 --> 25:18.440
Most of the pigeons

25:19.220 --> 25:20.200
from the north towns

25:20.220 --> 25:22.130
will go through this place.

25:26.380 --> 25:28.370
Si Lili is already being tracked.

25:28.580 --> 25:30.770
Multiple teams are hunting her down.

25:33.620 --> 25:35.460
Wait a minute! How do you know

25:35.460 --> 25:36.170
the pigeons of the Investigator's Office

25:36.170 --> 25:37.650
must go through here?

25:40.580 --> 25:42.030
Honestly,

25:42.050 --> 25:43.440
I have spent some time in the office

25:44.340 --> 25:46.080
raising pigeons.

25:46.100 --> 25:46.980
Won't it be noticed

25:46.980 --> 25:48.410
that you shot their pigeon?

25:48.650 --> 25:50.620
The Investigator's Office usually

25:50.620 --> 25:52.270
sends out several pigeons in one go.

25:52.290 --> 25:54.630
It's doesn't matter to have one of them missing.

25:54.650 --> 25:56.010
Won't anyone notice it?

25:56.410 --> 25:58.960
As pigeons usually come across predators like eagles

25:58.980 --> 26:01.840
during their fly,

26:01.860 --> 26:04.410
there is natural loss every month.

26:04.530 --> 26:05.630
Besides,

26:05.650 --> 26:07.380
I've raised pigeons for some time.

26:07.380 --> 26:08.130
So I know

26:08.130 --> 26:09.700
the number of pigeons coming back

26:09.700 --> 26:10.680
always fluctuates.

26:10.700 --> 26:12.680
No one will suspect.

26:14.100 --> 26:17.080
What else have you raised other than pigeons?

26:17.700 --> 26:19.680
Why do you ask so?

26:19.700 --> 26:21.110
Save for a rainy day.

26:21.130 --> 26:23.200
I must get prepared anyhow.

26:39.770 --> 26:41.960
Here you go, sir! Tea for you!

26:55.930 --> 26:56.480
Your Excellency,

26:56.500 --> 26:57.630
I collected messages from different towns.

26:57.650 --> 26:58.620
Two of the teams have been captured.

26:58.620 --> 26:59.650
Neither of them is Si Lili.

26:59.650 --> 27:01.480
The rest four teams are still being hunted.

27:03.980 --> 27:05.600
How about Fan Xian? Is he still after her?

27:05.620 --> 27:07.440
Fan Xian should not be able to catch up now.

27:10.500 --> 27:12.860
Does Si Lili keep running towards the north?

27:12.860 --> 27:14.390
Yeah, all the way north.

27:14.410 --> 27:16.130
She should be heading to Beiqi.

27:16.170 --> 27:17.480
Fetch the map!

27:17.500 --> 27:18.230
Yes!

27:18.250 --> 27:21.290
It's always passive to go from the behind.

27:21.340 --> 27:22.510
As soon as we can figure out

27:22.530 --> 27:23.700
where Si Lili

27:23.700 --> 27:24.560
is running to,

27:24.580 --> 27:25.700
we will be able to find the path

27:25.700 --> 27:27.650
she has to go through.

27:31.620 --> 27:32.720
Your Excellency, check this out!

27:32.740 --> 27:35.650
This is a territory map I drew of

27:36.770 --> 27:39.600
the mountains and rivers in the world.

27:44.290 --> 27:45.510
This map

27:45.530 --> 27:48.320
illustrates the scenic spots of the capital city in detail.

27:48.340 --> 27:50.050
Two taels of silver.

27:53.130 --> 27:56.410
It's super clear, isn't it?

27:57.410 --> 27:59.130
I don't understand it at all.

28:00.980 --> 28:02.580
Your Excellency, first of all,

28:02.580 --> 28:03.510
we need to confirm

28:03.530 --> 28:05.100
if Si Lili

28:05.100 --> 28:06.630
is from Beiqi.

28:06.650 --> 28:08.030
Her token as a secret agent is confirmed.

28:08.050 --> 28:08.990
She is from Beiqi.

28:09.010 --> 28:09.580
OK.

28:09.580 --> 28:11.320
So she must go north.

28:11.340 --> 28:12.220
But there are many ways

28:12.220 --> 28:13.250
to go north.

28:13.250 --> 28:15.010
But there are many military passes as well.

28:15.010 --> 28:16.870
There aren't many ways

28:16.890 --> 28:18.720
to go to Beiqi

28:18.740 --> 28:20.130
without going through these passes.

28:20.130 --> 28:21.560
Hold on a second.

28:21.890 --> 28:22.980
What do these triangles

28:22.980 --> 28:24.100
stand for?

28:24.100 --> 28:26.370
Mountain ranges. Don't you understand?

28:26.820 --> 28:27.840
How about these circles?

28:27.860 --> 28:29.480
Can' you see that they are lakes?!

28:29.500 --> 28:30.360
And these rectangles?

28:30.380 --> 28:31.410
Some are big and some are small.

28:31.410 --> 28:32.460
Big ones are castles.

28:32.460 --> 28:34.030
Small ones are passes.

28:34.050 --> 28:34.620
Can't you understand

28:34.620 --> 28:36.360
all these signs?

28:36.380 --> 28:37.500
Wang,

28:37.500 --> 28:38.620
your drawing

28:38.620 --> 28:40.370
is really extraordinary.

28:40.530 --> 28:43.840
Your Excellency, I feel flattered.

28:45.410 --> 28:46.770
That is to say,

28:46.930 --> 28:49.110
Si Lili must go through this little town

28:49.130 --> 28:52.010
since she wants to go to Beiqi quickly.

28:52.460 --> 28:54.220
This town is the only way

28:54.220 --> 28:55.440
to Beiqi.

28:55.460 --> 28:57.870
If she chooses any other way,

28:57.890 --> 28:59.440
it will take far more time.

28:59.460 --> 29:00.720
I'll arrange

29:00.740 --> 29:02.200
a tight encirclement right away

29:02.220 --> 29:04.110
and gather all the secret agents here.

29:04.130 --> 29:05.010
We'll surely capture Si Lili

29:05.010 --> 29:05.910
and take her back to the capital city.

29:05.930 --> 29:06.990
Off you go!

29:07.010 --> 29:08.200
Yes!

29:08.860 --> 29:11.200
Now that I can detect this,

29:11.380 --> 29:12.360
so can

29:12.380 --> 29:14.200
His Excellency Zhu.

29:14.220 --> 29:15.630
I don't think we have time

29:15.650 --> 29:17.270
to capture Si Lili.

29:17.290 --> 29:19.230
But the Investigator's Office has a lot of ears.

29:19.250 --> 29:20.050
They can capture

29:20.050 --> 29:21.440
Si Lili for sure.

29:21.460 --> 29:23.990
No, I must interrogate her in person.

29:24.010 --> 29:25.410
Definitely!

29:26.010 --> 29:27.410
We just need to

29:27.770 --> 29:29.510
go north slowly

29:29.530 --> 29:31.700
and intercept the team

29:31.700 --> 29:33.200
that escorts Si Lili back to the capital city.

29:33.220 --> 29:34.820
When it comes, just take out
your token as Director-General

29:34.820 --> 29:36.200
and require them to hand over the suspect.

29:36.220 --> 29:38.080
No one will dare to disobey.

29:52.100 --> 29:54.680
Your Excellency, what's up?

29:58.980 --> 30:00.220
I'm feeling a bit worried

30:00.220 --> 30:01.440
ever since I came out of the capital city.

30:01.460 --> 30:03.150
What you said just now

30:03.170 --> 30:04.840
makes it even worse.

30:04.860 --> 30:06.800
Did I say anything wrong?

30:07.410 --> 30:08.750
I'm also wondering

30:08.770 --> 30:10.440
your drawing is simple

30:10.460 --> 30:11.840
but your words

30:11.860 --> 30:13.130
are full of wisdom.

30:13.170 --> 30:15.930
Your Excellency, let's keep going while talking.

30:15.930 --> 30:18.150
Wait a minute. Let me think about

30:18.170 --> 30:19.340
which sentence is it

30:19.340 --> 30:20.960
that makes me feel not right.

30:29.050 --> 30:31.440
I got it!

30:32.290 --> 30:34.560
Si Lili burnt the boat

30:34.580 --> 30:35.720
and rode a horse out of town.

30:35.740 --> 30:36.740
It must attract the attention

30:36.740 --> 30:38.270
of the Investigator's Office.

30:38.290 --> 30:40.600
Even though she arranged six teams,

30:40.620 --> 30:42.770
but her rough direction is to the north.

30:44.050 --> 30:45.720
Is there anything wrong with that?

30:45.740 --> 30:47.510
The description is right, but the story is not right.

30:47.530 --> 30:48.510
Have you ever considered

30:48.530 --> 30:50.480
why Si Lili had to escape?

30:50.740 --> 30:52.800
She is involved in the assassination at Niulan Street.

30:52.820 --> 30:54.650
Of course, she needs to escape as soon as she can.

30:54.650 --> 30:56.320
Then why would she burn the boat?

30:56.340 --> 30:58.200
The boat...

30:58.380 --> 31:00.890
She wanted to escape. Then escape!

31:01.050 --> 31:02.360
What's the point of burning the boat?

31:02.380 --> 31:04.320
Perhaps there were confidential letters

31:04.530 --> 31:06.230
on the boat.

31:06.250 --> 31:07.930
Then just burn the letters.

31:08.050 --> 31:09.390
Right! It would be enough to burn the letters.

31:09.410 --> 31:10.720
Why did she burn the boat?

31:10.740 --> 31:11.840
Second question.

31:11.860 --> 31:13.510
Why would she ride a horse out of town

31:13.530 --> 31:14.600
and arrange six teams?

31:14.620 --> 31:16.930
Certainly, to create confusion.

31:17.220 --> 31:19.030
What if she disguised herself

31:19.050 --> 31:21.170
and went out of town secretly?

31:22.820 --> 31:25.200
No one ever suspected her yesterday.

31:25.220 --> 31:27.150
If she leaves secretly,

31:27.170 --> 31:28.600
it would be far more difficult to find her.

31:28.620 --> 31:30.080
But she still cut a splash

31:30.100 --> 31:31.870
by burning the boat and taking
a horse which is eye-catching.

31:31.890 --> 31:32.990
What's the purpose of that?

31:33.010 --> 31:36.480
To let everyone know

31:36.530 --> 31:38.600
she had left.

31:39.980 --> 31:41.750
At that time point, everyone's attention

31:41.770 --> 31:43.410
would be on the north of the capital city,

31:43.410 --> 31:45.320
trying to figure out her escaping route.

31:45.340 --> 31:46.840
If I were her,

31:47.220 --> 31:48.600
it's the right time

31:48.620 --> 31:49.530
to get disappeared

31:49.530 --> 31:50.960
when everyone's attention is diverted.

32:19.170 --> 32:20.800
That means

32:21.220 --> 32:22.480
none of these six teams

32:22.500 --> 32:24.840
has Si Lili in them.

32:25.460 --> 32:26.870
The real Si Lili

32:26.890 --> 32:27.740
has long lurked

32:27.740 --> 32:29.440
outside of everyone's attention.

32:30.930 --> 32:33.130
That's something hard to understand.

32:33.380 --> 32:34.340
It makes sense

32:34.340 --> 32:35.560
if she escapes silently.

32:35.580 --> 32:37.650
Why did she do all that?

32:38.100 --> 32:39.460
Because of the tension

32:39.460 --> 32:40.510
between Nanqing and Beiqi at the moment.

32:40.530 --> 32:41.960
War could break out any time soon.

32:41.980 --> 32:43.750
What's the connection with that?

32:43.770 --> 32:45.750
The security at the north must be very strict now.

32:45.770 --> 32:48.010
It's not the right time for her to go.

32:48.050 --> 32:49.600
There would be an equally lot of passes

32:49.620 --> 32:51.110
which are equally strict

32:51.130 --> 32:52.390
if she escapes secretly.

32:52.410 --> 32:53.220
After she did all that,

32:53.220 --> 32:54.010
the security at the north

32:54.010 --> 32:56.370
will check more strictly.

33:00.500 --> 33:03.170
So she doesn't necessarily go north.

33:04.050 --> 33:05.650
Doesn't she go back to Beiqi?

33:05.890 --> 33:07.250
She does!

33:10.010 --> 33:11.230
Wang Qinian

33:11.250 --> 33:12.500
is there any other way to Beiqi

33:12.500 --> 33:14.440
without going north?

33:15.700 --> 33:18.530
The way to Beiqi without going north?!

33:19.500 --> 33:20.960
Isn't that...

33:27.580 --> 33:29.250
There is indeed a way.

33:29.290 --> 33:30.200
Tell me about it!

33:30.220 --> 33:32.230
Instead of going north, go east directly.

33:32.250 --> 33:35.050
Find the merchant ships and return to Beiqi by sea.

33:35.500 --> 33:36.800
Which port is the most possible?

33:36.820 --> 33:39.320
Dongyi Town! Oh no!

33:40.530 --> 33:43.910
We have very strict security at Dongyi Town.

33:43.930 --> 33:45.230
Besides, there are a lot of passes

33:45.250 --> 33:47.290
on the way to Dongyi Town as well.

33:47.860 --> 33:49.680
Other than that,

33:51.380 --> 33:52.800
this would be the most possible place.

33:53.530 --> 33:54.220
Your Excellency,

33:54.220 --> 33:55.910
do you find this place familiar?

33:55.930 --> 33:56.890
With your drawing like this,

33:56.890 --> 33:58.290
how should I find it familiar? Just say it.

33:58.290 --> 33:59.620
This is the place

33:59.620 --> 34:02.170
Your Excellency grow up.

34:03.340 --> 34:04.050
Danzhou harbor.

34:04.050 --> 34:06.010
Yes, it is!

34:06.130 --> 34:08.320
It's all within Nanqing

34:08.340 --> 34:10.320
from the capital city to Danzhou harbor.

34:10.340 --> 34:12.230
So it should be Danzhou harbor.

34:12.250 --> 34:13.470
Check it out again!

34:13.490 --> 34:14.900
From the north gate of the capital city

34:14.900 --> 34:16.010
to Danzhou harbor,

34:16.010 --> 34:17.600
which route is the most convenient?

34:23.690 --> 34:25.130
What?

34:26.340 --> 34:28.270
There is a lot of mountain ranges

34:28.290 --> 34:31.320
and passes during the way

34:32.050 --> 34:33.600
from the north gate to Danzhou harbor.

34:33.620 --> 34:35.490
That's not an easy route either.

34:39.860 --> 34:41.510
There is a simpler way.

34:41.530 --> 34:42.560
What is it?

34:42.580 --> 34:44.640
To return to the capital

34:44.660 --> 34:46.650
and depart from the east gate.

35:17.010 --> 35:18.490
To the east gate.

35:33.620 --> 35:35.040
Stop!

35:37.860 --> 35:39.080
Stand back!

35:43.380 --> 35:44.800
Where are you going?

35:44.820 --> 35:46.240
I'm seriously ill.

35:46.340 --> 35:48.520
My hometown is said to have a famous doctor,

35:48.940 --> 35:50.410
so I want to go there and have a try.

35:51.180 --> 35:52.430
Go! Go! Go!

35:52.450 --> 35:53.560
Thank you!

36:04.420 --> 36:05.520
Stop!

36:24.970 --> 36:26.400
You don't need to go back.

36:26.420 --> 36:27.880
Move the carriage into the woods and burn it.

36:27.900 --> 36:30.080
After that, leave to different directions
and don't leave any mark.

36:30.100 --> 36:31.180
Yes!

36:40.010 --> 36:41.420
According to Your Excellency's reasoning,

36:41.420 --> 36:42.380
Si Lili may be ahead of us

36:42.380 --> 36:44.160
for a short distance.

36:44.180 --> 36:46.030
Indeed! Judging from their reaction,

36:46.050 --> 36:47.010
Zhu Ge should find out

36:47.010 --> 36:48.950
Si Lili's whereabouts today.

36:48.970 --> 36:50.120
If she is patient enough,

36:50.140 --> 36:50.970
she will wait for the Investigator's Office

36:50.970 --> 36:52.510
to focus its attention all on the north

36:52.530 --> 36:54.240
before she returns back to go eastwards.

36:54.380 --> 36:57.270
Your Excellency's wisdom is indeed stunning.

36:57.290 --> 36:59.640
I am totally shocked

36:59.660 --> 37:01.600
by your extraordinary talent.

37:01.620 --> 37:04.690
It gives me a constant sense of anxiety.

37:11.000 --> 37:13.590
=Inn=

37:19.490 --> 37:20.140
Excuse me,

37:20.140 --> 37:21.420
feed my horse with premium forage

37:21.420 --> 37:22.450
and give me a premium room.

37:22.450 --> 37:24.240
Sure! This way please.

37:34.820 --> 37:36.120
This is the room for you.

37:36.140 --> 37:37.650
This way please.

37:45.900 --> 37:47.240
Enjoy your stay!

38:01.010 --> 38:02.990
Gentlemen, do you need accommodation?

38:03.010 --> 38:04.280
No!

38:05.340 --> 38:05.840
Yes!

38:05.860 --> 38:07.320
Sure! Please come this way!

38:08.620 --> 38:10.640
Your Excellency, let's have a look inside.

38:10.660 --> 38:11.740
Come!

38:35.660 --> 38:37.930
Sir, come this way!

38:38.210 --> 38:39.710
Get us a good room!

38:39.730 --> 38:40.840
Sure!

38:46.010 --> 38:47.210
This is it.

38:54.530 --> 38:56.230
Sir, that one is taken.

38:56.250 --> 38:58.080
Come this way!

38:59.730 --> 39:01.280
I'm sorry!

39:05.420 --> 39:06.100
This room

39:06.100 --> 39:07.420
faces the sun and it's spacious.

39:07.420 --> 39:08.760
It's very cozy!

39:10.250 --> 39:10.770
Your Excellency!

39:10.770 --> 39:12.170
Do we really need the room?

39:13.450 --> 39:16.560
Your Excellency, trust me!

39:16.580 --> 39:17.800
After the long journey of hunting,

39:17.820 --> 39:20.450
rest is more important than time.

39:20.900 --> 39:22.280
Please!

39:28.660 --> 39:29.760
Please!

39:29.970 --> 39:31.450
Get us some hot water!

39:31.530 --> 39:33.370
Sure! Please wait a moment!

39:34.490 --> 39:36.650
How come Fan Xian is here?

39:55.250 --> 39:56.450
Waiter!

39:58.730 --> 40:00.650
Miss, what can I do for you?

40:06.970 --> 40:08.410
Coming!

40:12.660 --> 40:14.230
Sir, here comes the food for you.

40:14.250 --> 40:15.190
Close the door!

40:15.210 --> 40:16.490
Enjoy!

40:20.580 --> 40:21.730
Your Excellency,

40:22.140 --> 40:23.270
if Si Lili

40:23.290 --> 40:25.370
really goes eastward,

40:25.900 --> 40:27.190
we'll surely catch up with her

40:27.210 --> 40:29.450
in two to three days.

40:29.620 --> 40:31.130
She should have a horse.

40:31.860 --> 40:33.280
Your Excellency,

40:33.530 --> 40:36.130
if there is no backup horse,

40:36.180 --> 40:39.190
she won't travel that fast with just one horse.

40:39.210 --> 40:39.990
Just think about it!

40:40.010 --> 40:42.160
The horse needs to take rests once in a while

40:42.180 --> 40:43.360
when it is running.

40:43.380 --> 40:45.010
And it has to be fed

40:45.010 --> 40:46.880
with premium forage from time to time,

40:46.900 --> 40:48.030
otherwise it will die

40:48.050 --> 40:50.800
of fatigue.

40:50.820 --> 40:51.640
The road we take

40:51.660 --> 40:54.760
is actually a short cut between the hills

40:54.820 --> 40:57.000
which is faster than the official road.

40:58.530 --> 41:00.690
The shortest way is the straight line between two points.

41:01.770 --> 41:03.450
What did you say?

41:03.620 --> 41:05.210
Nothing!

41:06.010 --> 41:07.410
Your Excellency,

41:07.900 --> 41:10.470
will you pay

41:10.490 --> 41:12.170
for the room and food?

41:12.490 --> 41:13.640
Certainly!

41:13.660 --> 41:15.280
Then it's not that weary!

41:15.860 --> 41:17.560
Let's finish it!

41:18.250 --> 41:19.600
Wait!

41:21.530 --> 41:22.970
After you, Your Excellency!

41:32.250 --> 41:33.730
It's poisonous!

41:35.770 --> 41:37.130
Is it...

41:37.290 --> 41:39.560
It seems we don't need to wait for two to three days.

41:40.050 --> 41:40.950
It is made

41:40.970 --> 41:42.010
by the kitchen.

41:42.010 --> 41:43.470
Where did you fetch it after taken from the kitchen?

41:43.490 --> 41:44.860
I fetched it directly to your room.

41:44.860 --> 41:46.280
Who touched it in between?

41:47.010 --> 41:47.420
No one!

41:47.420 --> 41:48.160
Alright!

41:48.180 --> 41:49.640
Then you're solely liable.

41:49.660 --> 41:50.840
Come with me!

41:51.250 --> 41:52.180
Look at him!

41:52.180 --> 41:53.490
Look at him with your own eyes!

42:02.970 --> 42:03.950
Don't you leave!

42:03.970 --> 42:05.360
There is poison in the food and someone died with it.

42:05.380 --> 42:06.750
What do we do now? I'll notify the imperial court!

42:06.770 --> 42:07.320
No! No!

42:07.340 --> 42:07.860
Well...

42:07.860 --> 42:09.050
How could it happen?

42:09.050 --> 42:09.860
I'm afraid you're the murder

42:09.860 --> 42:10.880
in this case.

42:10.900 --> 42:11.620
No! No! No!

42:11.620 --> 42:12.750
It's not me! It's not me!

42:12.770 --> 42:13.450
Didn't you say

42:13.450 --> 42:14.900
only the kitchen and you touched the food?

42:14.900 --> 42:15.660
Or this inn

42:15.660 --> 42:16.560
is a sinister inn?

42:16.580 --> 42:17.690
No! No!

42:17.690 --> 42:19.840
A lady touched it!

42:20.970 --> 42:22.280
Who is the lady?

42:22.450 --> 42:24.360
She checked in this afternoon as well!

42:24.380 --> 42:25.100
She insisted on

42:25.100 --> 42:26.510
checking out the quality of the food here

42:26.530 --> 42:28.670
before she decided whether to eat here or not.

42:28.690 --> 42:30.180
So I brought your food box to her

42:30.180 --> 42:31.250
to have a look.

42:31.250 --> 42:32.950
I did nothing else.

42:32.970 --> 42:35.000
Why did you pick ours in particular?

42:35.290 --> 42:36.510
Because you live close!

42:36.530 --> 42:37.970
Just the opposite side.

42:42.620 --> 42:45.080
He is alive again!

43:13.280 --> 43:16.860
In the river of history,

43:16.880 --> 43:20.350
time goes round and round.

43:23.160 --> 43:26.500
Memories about the former and present lives

43:26.520 --> 43:30.590
join each other in an endless way.

43:32.480 --> 43:35.100
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:35.120 --> 43:37.360
one season follows another in a flash,

43:37.360 --> 43:39.860
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:39.880 --> 43:41.480
I just can't give up

43:41.480 --> 43:44.820
to be with you for my whole life.

43:44.840 --> 43:50.310
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:51.560 --> 43:54.110
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:54.400 --> 43:56.440
Year after year in the wandering,

43:56.440 --> 43:59.100
I count the remaining years.

43:59.120 --> 44:01.300
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:01.320 --> 44:03.310
even though we have ended up the destiny,

44:03.600 --> 44:05.990
I never feel regretful.

44:06.040 --> 44:07.400
In such a chaotic world,

44:07.400 --> 44:10.380
I still miss you as ever.

44:10.400 --> 44:13.350
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:13.640 --> 44:15.700
With a gentle heart,

44:15.720 --> 44:18.380
I cherish our remaining years.

44:18.400 --> 44:19.920
Even though we have to go through

44:19.920 --> 44:22.430
all the hardships along the journey,

44:22.560 --> 44:29.750
you always stay by my side,

44:29.840 --> 44:32.510
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:32.800 --> 44:34.880
Year after year in the wandering,

44:34.880 --> 44:37.540
I count the remaining years.

44:37.560 --> 44:39.700
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:39.720 --> 44:41.950
even though we end up the destiny,

44:42.160 --> 44:44.340
I never feel regretful.

44:44.360 --> 44:45.760
In such a chaotic world,

44:45.760 --> 44:48.820
I still miss you as ever.

44:48.840 --> 44:51.950
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:52.040 --> 44:54.180
With a gentle heart,

44:54.200 --> 44:56.900
I cherish our remaining years.

44:56.920 --> 44:58.360
Even though we have to go through

44:58.360 --> 45:01.020
all the hardships along the journey,

45:01.040 --> 45:09.800
you always stay by my side...
